17.00 bis 19.00 Uhr</div><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#0F5661;margin:14px 0 6px;">Wo</div><div style="font-size:14.5px;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.6;">Restaurant MeetPoint, Dukagjini Residence, Hyrja A,<br>Rr. Xhevdet Doda, Prishtine 10000</div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:18px 26px 4px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;">Komm einfach vorbei. Wir freuen uns, dich kennenzulernen.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:16px 26px 22px;"><div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#0f2830;">Antonia Huber</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#5b6b70;">Head of Recruiting</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#5b6b70;">25hours</div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 26px 22px;font-size:11px;color:#9ca3af;line-height:1.5;border-top:1px solid #eef2f3;">Diese Einladung kommt von 25hours Recruiting, Prishtina. Antworten gehen an recruiting@25hrs.net.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>$body$, true)
